keywords:
  - economic data
  - financial time series
  - macroeconomics
  - official statistics
  - panel data
  - cross-country data
  - economic indicators
  - open data
abstract: >-
  Free, non-commercial academic data library for economic and financial
  statistics: ~7.73 billion individual time series and ~79.8 billion
  observations (store census 2026-07-02), surfaced through a curated catalog
  of 1.23 million searchable entries from 182 served sources — international
  organizations, national statistical offices, central banks, and research
  datasets hosted with written permission. Producer-first attribution ships
  with every download; access via website, free REST API, MCP server, and
  Python/R clients. Part of the ElkassabgiData family.
